*** {{IPA|cy|/ˈbət/|a=South Wales,[[w:strut-comma merger|strut-comma merger]]}}
*** {{IPA|en|/ˈbɜt/|a=[[w:fronting|/ʌ/-fronting]],Midland US,Southern US,AAVE}}
*** {{IPA|en|/ˈbɐ̞t/|a=AU,NZ}}
