#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Concepcion de Leon|title=5 Things Well-Meaning People Say to Me That Are Actually Really Offensive|work=[[w:Glamour (magazine)|Glamour]]|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230208093938/https://www.glamour.com/story/5-things-well-meaning-people-say-to-me-that-are-actually-really-offensive|location=Greenwich, C.T.;{{nb...|New York, N.Y.; Los Angeles, C.A.}}|publisher=[[w:Condé Nast|Condé Nast Publications]]|date=28 December 2016|issn=0017-0747|oclc=5259082|passage="I support you/understand where you're coming from, but..." ¶ No. No "'''buts'''" when it comes to other people's survival.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Catriona Harvey-Jenner|title=8 foods you should never eat before a workout|work=[[w:Cosmopolitan (magazine)|Cosmopolitan]]|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230128234014/https://www.cosmopolitan.com/uk/body/diet-nutrition/a23280061/foods-never-eat-before-workout/|location=New York, N.Y.|publisher=w:Hearst Communications|date=17 September 2018|issn=0010-9541|oclc=1770745|passage=But - and this is a pretty important '''but''' - it's just as bad to eat the ''wrong'' thing before a workout as it is to eat nothing at all.}}
