#* {{quote-song|en|year=1984|lyricist={{w|Fish (singer)|Fish}}|artist=w:Marillion|album={{w|Fugazi (album)|Fugazi}}|title=Fugazi|text=Pandora's box of holocausts gracefully cruising satellite infested heavens, waiting, the season of the '''button''', the penultimate migration, radioactive perfumes for the fashionably, for the terminally, insane.}}
