===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:carpette|tree=1}}

From late {{inh|en|enm|carpette}}, from {{der|en|fro|carpite}}, from {{der|en|la-med|carpita}} or {{der|en|it|carpita}}, introduced in the 13th century by the {{w|Republic of Florence|Florentines}} from the [[Armenian Kingdom of Cilicia]], from {{der|en|axm|կարպետ|t=carpet, rug}}, earlier {{m|axm|կապերտ}}.

