#* {{RQ:Shakespeare King Lear Q1|act=III|scene=ii|sig=&#91;F4&#93;|page=55|passage=Blovv vvind & cracke your cheekes, rage, blovv / You '''caterickes''', & Hircanios ſpout til you haue drencht, / The ſteeples drovvn'd the cockes, {{...}}|translation=Blow, wind, and crack your cheeks, rage, blow, / You '''cataracts''' and hurricanes, spout till you have drenched / The steeples, drowned the cocks, {{...}}}}
