#* {{RQ:Milton Paradise Lost|lines=174–176|sig=&#91;D4&#93;|verso=1|page=33|passage=[W]hat if all / Her ſtores vvere op'n'd, and this Firmament / Of Hell, ſhould ſpout her '''Cataracts''' of Fire, {{...}}}}

