From {{bor|en|fr|cape}}, from {{der|en|pro|capa}}, from {{der|en|la-lat|cappa||cape}}. The second sense ("superhero") is metonymic from the fact that many superheroes wear capes. Likewise, the verb sense "defend, praise" alludes to the stereotypical depiction of [[superhero]]es wearing capes when they come to people's defense. (Compare {{m|en|caped crusader}}.) {{doublet|en|capa|cappa}}.

