===Etymology===
{{dercat|en|ira|ira-pro|iir-pro|ine-pro}}
[[File:Camels in Jordan valley (4568207363).jpg|250px|thumb|A caravan of camels in Jordan valley (West Bank)]]
[[File:117 Qek, Castiglione 2005 002.jpg|thumb|A [[car]] pulling a caravan]]
From {{der|en|frm|caravane}}, from {{der|en|fro|carvane}}, from {{der|en|fa|کاروان|tr=kârvân}}, from {{der|en|pal|kʾlwʾn'|tr=kārawān}}, from {{der|en|peo|𐎣𐎠𐎼|t=people, subjects}}.

The word was used to designate a group of people who were travelling by camel or horse on the [[Silk Road]]. {{doublet|en|Kairouan}}.

